# Track the Go ``internal/storage/`` package — the generic
# ``storage/`` rule above was meant for data dirs (./data/storage,
# etc.), not Go source. Exception must come AFTER the broader rule.
!services/chat-edge-api/internal/storage/
!services/chat-edge-api/internal/storage/**
uploads/
*.sqlite3
admin-ui/tsconfig.tsbuildinfo
backend/uploads/

# Perf-baseline track (deferred) — source lives on branch
